    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d84">

                <pb facs="0260" n="890" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v2/pg890"/>

                <head>No. 390.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-02-15"><hi rendition="#italic">February</hi> 15,
                        1873</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Officially received to-day, with great ceremony, by Chief Executive
                        Figueras, and also by president of sovereign assembly,
                        Martos. Addresses of each most friendly. Shall I report
                    remarks by cable? Proceedings reported to assembly by
                        Castelar in brief and brilliant speech. Order assured;
                    funds rising$ confidence established.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>SICKLES.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
